    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tabletop Tumult \u2013 Defend the Castle in a Unique Asymmetric Co-op Adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of <i>Tabletop Tumult</i>, an innovative VR co-op game that blends strategy and action seamlessly! Your mission? Defend a medieval castle from waves of enemies and climb the leaderboard \u2013 together with your teammate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience asymmetric gameplay where the VR player takes charge of the battlefield, gathers resources, and builds defenses, while the PC player fights enemies head-on, strategically eliminates threats, and supports the team. After each enemy wave, you\u2019ll select new upgrades to become stronger and prepare for the next challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asymmetric Co-op Gameplay:</strong> Team up with a partner \u2013 whether they\u2019re in VR or on PC.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategy Meets Action:</strong> Build defenses, fight with sword and bow, and adapt your tactics to succeed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades and Customization:</strong> Collect resources, enhance your skills, and fine-tune your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Difficulty:</strong> Face escalating enemy waves, culminating in epic boss battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible for Everyone:</strong> Perfect for seasoned gamers and newcomers alike \u2013 thanks to the interactive tutorial and distinct roles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the challenge and face the ultimate waves of enemies with your teammate! <i>Tabletop Tumult</i> delivers an unforgettable and immersive gaming experience.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tabletop Tumult \u2013 Defend the Castle in a Unique Asymmetric Co-op Adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of <i>Tabletop Tumult</i>, an innovative VR co-op game that blends strategy and action seamlessly! Your mission? Defend a medieval castle from waves of enemies and climb the leaderboard \u2013 together with your teammate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience asymmetric gameplay where the VR player takes charge of the battlefield, gathers resources, and builds defenses, while the PC player fights enemies head-on, strategically eliminates threats, and supports the team. After each enemy wave, you\u2019ll select new upgrades to become stronger and prepare for the next challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asymmetric Co-op Gameplay:</strong> Team up with a partner \u2013 whether they\u2019re in VR or on PC.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategy Meets Action:</strong> Build defenses, fight with sword and bow, and adapt your tactics to succeed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades and Customization:</strong> Collect resources, enhance your skills, and fine-tune your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Difficulty:</strong> Face escalating enemy waves, culminating in epic boss battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible for Everyone:</strong> Perfect for seasoned gamers and newcomers alike \u2013 thanks to the interactive tutorial and distinct roles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the challenge and face the ultimate waves of enemies with your teammate! <i>Tabletop Tumult</i> delivers an unforgettable and immersive gaming experience.</p>",
    "short_description": "Defend your castle in thrilling PC VR co-op battles! Team up, build defenses, and face waves of enemies. Strategy and teamwork are key to victory \u2013 are you ready to save your fortress?",
